## Common 3DS Issues & Fixes

| Issue | Symptoms | Debug | Fix |
|-------|----------|-------|-----|
| **3DS not triggered** | CAVV/ECI always null, payment succeeds without challenge | Frontend logs show no auth data | Check if test card requires 3DS (e.g., use 4000002500003155 for Visa test) |
| **"Invalid CAVV"** | Backend receives CAVV but NMI rejects it | NMI response: `"cavv_response": "N"` | Verify CAVV format (should be base64), check ECI value matches NMI specs |
| **Missing XID** | Backend receives CAVV/ECI but XID is null | Frontend logs show `xid: undefined` | Ensure `onAuthentication(authData)` is called; may need different NMI package version |
| **3DS popup never appears** | Widget loads but no challenge dialog | Browser console shows no errors | Check pop-up blocker, try opening devtools before testing |
| **"Cardholder authentication failed"** | 3DS challenge appears but always fails | NMI logs show auth rejection | Use correct test OTP (varies by bank), or disable 3DS on test card |
| **CORS error in browser** | Network request blocked, 3DS server unreachable | Console: `"CORS policy: No Access-Control-Allow-Origin"` | Check Startup.cs CORS policy, ensure NMI domain is allowed |

