## Logging Strategy

Enable verbose logging in your controller to trace the full flow:

```csharp
_logger.LogInformation("STEP 1: Request received with token: {Token}", paymentToken);
_logger.LogInformation("STEP 2: Extracted 3DS fields - CAVV: {Cavv}, ECI: {Eci}", cavv, eci);
_logger.LogInformation("STEP 3: Sending to NMI...");
_logger.LogInformation("STEP 4: NMI Response: {Response}", nmiResponse);
_logger.LogInformation("STEP 5: Success! Transaction ID: {TxnId}", transactionId);
```

Then trace logs in terminal output during test.

